DATA.madTemplates = ["Dear {name}, every time I see you my {body} goes {adj}. You are the {adj2} {noun} I've ever met. I want to {verb} with you in {place} forever. Love, your {noun2}.","Our first date was at {place}. You wore a {adj} {noun} and I immediately fell in love. We ate {food} and talked about {topic} for {number} hours. Best day ever.","You are my {adj} {noun}. When you {verb}, my {body} does a little dance. I would {verb2} across {place} just to see you smile.","Roses are {color}, violets are {color2}, you are my {noun}, and my love is {adj}. I want to {verb} you every {day} of my life.","Breaking news: local {job} falls madly in love with {adj} partner at {place}! Witnesses report seeing them {verb} and eating {food} together. More at 11.","If you were a {noun}, you'd be the most {adj} one in {place}. I would {verb} you every single {day}. You make my {body} feel {emotion}.","I love you more than {food}, more than {food2}, and definitely more than {verb}ing on Sundays. You are my {adj} {noun} forever.","One day we were {verb}ing at {place} and I thought: this is the {adj} person I'll ever meet. Now look at us — {number} years of {noun} later!","You are the {adj} to my {noun}. Without you, my life would be as {adj2} as a {noun2} in {place}. Please never stop being my {emotion} {noun}.","My family thinks you're {adj}. My friends think you're {adj2}. I think you're the most {adj3} {noun} in the world. Let's {verb} together forever.","I want to wake up next to you in our {adj} house in {place}, with our {number} {animals} running around. We'll drink {drink} and {verb} every day.","When I first saw you at {place}, I dropped my {noun}. You were wearing {adj} {clothes} and I thought: I must {verb} this person.","Every {day} I come home and you're there with {food} and a {adj} smile. You make even {adj2} days feel {adj3}. You are my {noun}.","They say love is {adj}, but they never met us. We {verb} together, eat {food} together, and {verb2} together. That's true love.","Our love story: I was a {job}, you were a {job2}. We met at {place} over {food}. It was {adj}. The end. (Just kidding — it's just beginning!)","You + me + {place} + {food} = the {adj} equation in the universe. Let's solve it together every {day}.","I promise to always {verb} you, {verb2} with you, and share my {food} with you. Even when you're {adj} in the morning.","My {body} skips a beat when you {verb}. Your {body2} is my favorite place to {verb2}. You are my {adj} {noun} forever and always.","Reasons I love you #1: you're {adj}. #2: you make the best {food}. #3: you {verb} like nobody's watching. #4: that {body}. All of it.","If our love was a {noun}, it would be the most {adj} one in {place}. If it was a {food}, it would be {adj2} and delicious.","Every time you {verb}, I fall in love again. Every time you eat {food}, I fall harder. Every time you say my name, I melt like {food2} in the sun.","Anniversary toast: to the person who {verb}s with me at 3am, eats {food} with me at midnight, and still thinks I'm {adj}. Cheers!","You are sweeter than {food}, funnier than {noun}, and more {adj} than {adj2} {noun2}. I'd pick you in every universe.","I asked for a {adj} partner and the universe sent me you — {adj2}, {verb}ing, and perfect. I'd wait {number} more years.","Our wedding will be at {place}. You'll wear {adj} {clothes}. I'll {verb} when I see you. Our {animals} will be ring bearers.","Love means never having to say you're sorry for eating the last {food}. It also means always sharing your {food2}. I love you.","You had me at {verb}. You sealed the deal with {food}. You keep me with {adj} mornings and {adj2} nights.","If I had {number} wishes, I'd wish for you {number} times. Then I'd wish for {food} and a {adj} {noun}.","Being with you is like {verb}ing on a rainbow made of {food} — impossible, {adj}, and always {emotion}.","I love how you {verb} when nobody's watching. I love your {adj} {body}. I love that you'd choose {food} over fine dining. You're my {noun}.","Tonight, you and me, {place}, {food}, and the most {adj} sunset. I'll bring the {noun}, you bring that {adj} smile.","Roses are red, {food} is {color2}, I love you more than {verb}ing in bed. (And I really love {verb}ing in bed.)","They say behind every {adj} person is a {adj2} partner. Behind me is you — {verb}ing, laughing, and being my {noun}.","I'd give up {food} for you. I'd give up {food2} too. I'd even share my {noun}. That's how much you mean to me, you {adj} human.","You're the {noun} to my {noun2}, the {food} to my {food2}, the {adj} to my {adj2}. Complete me forever?","Let's {verb} under the stars in {place}. Let's eat {food} until we can't move. Let's be {adj} together forever.","My love for you is bigger than {place}, stronger than {number} {animals}, and more {adj} than {adj2} {noun2}.","I'd rather have bad wifi with you than perfect wifi alone. I'd rather eat burnt {food} with you than perfect {food2} alone.","You make me want to be a {adj} {job}. You make me want to {verb} every morning. You make {place} feel like home.","Your {body} against mine, your {adj} smell, your {verb}ing at night — I wouldn't change a single {noun} about you.","Dear future us: I hope we still {verb} together, eat {food} at midnight, and laugh like {adj} {animals} in {place}.","You're the reason I wake up {adj}. You're the reason I go to bed {adj2}. You're the reason my {body} is full.","If you ever doubt my love, remember: I gave you my {food}, I {verb}ed with you in public, and I said yes to your {adj} {noun}.","Forget {adj} princes and {adj2} princesses. I want a {noun} who {verb}s with me, eats {food} with me, and stays forever.","You are my {adj} {noun}, my {adj2} escape, my {food} partner, and the reason I smile like a {adj3} {animals} every day.","When the world gets {adj}, I think of you, our {place}, and that time we {verb}ed until we cried. Then everything is okay.","I don't need {noun} or {noun2} — just you, me, {food}, and a {adj} view of {place}. That's my happy place.","My love for you is like {food} — it only gets better with time. Unlike {food2}, which gets moldy. See? Poetry.","Let's run away together. We'll {verb} in {place}, eat {food} for breakfast, and be {adj} forever. Deal?","You're not just my {noun}. You're my {noun2}, my {food} partner, my {adj} morning, and my {emotion} ending.","I'd choose you over {number} {animals}, over {adj} {noun}, over all the {food} in the world. Always you.","You make me want to be a {adj} {job}, a {verb}er, and a {noun2} owner. You make me want to be better for us.","Every love story is {adj}, but ours is my favorite. It has {food}, {place}, {verb}ing, and two people who chose each other.","I'll love you when the {animals} fly and when {food} grows on trees. I'll love you when the world stops {verb}ing.","You + me = {adj} babies, {adj} house, {adj} life. (The babies part — let's ask our {animals} first.)","Thank you for {verb}ing with me at 3am, for {adj} mornings, for {food} at 2am, and for being my {noun}.","I never believed in {adj} love stories until you {verb}ed into my life at {place}. Now I can't imagine {noun} without you.","Our relationship in 3 words: {adj}, {adj2}, {adj3}. In 3 foods: {food}, {food2}, {food3}. In 1 word: home.","Every day with you is a new episode of the {adj} show called 'Us'. Today's episode: we {verb}ed at {place} and ate {food}.","I love you like {animals} love {food}. I need you like {place} needs {noun2}. You are my everything, my {adj} {noun}.","Let's be that {adj} old couple who {verb}s in the park and shares {food} on a bench. I'll love you even when you're {adj2}."];
